IMPORT prelude

-- The other one. Its `Thing` is a different entity from `duplicate-type-a`'s,
-- with a different field of a different type. L4 tells them apart by unique
-- and is content; Catala has one flat namespace and cannot.

DECLARE Thing
    HAS m IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN x IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Thing
`from b` x MEANS Thing WITH m IS x
